<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103158" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέρθριος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rope from the end of a
			sail-yard</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέρθρον</span>), used for
			reefing, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				440
			</span></i>, cf. Sch. ad loc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. κάλοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Erot.
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.145
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τερθρία πνοή</span>, cited from <i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				333
			</span></i>) in <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				753.7
			</span></i>, is there expld. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπισθία</span>, a <i>stern</i> wind, but perh. rather a
				<i>stiff</i> gale requiring the use of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέρθριοι</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
